@host = http://localhost:8080

### Enqueue a job that fails twice before succeeding (watch the retries in the logs)
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "email.send", "queue": "emails", "payload": { "to": "ana@example.com", "subject": "Hi", "failFirst": 2 } }

### Same idempotency key twice -> the second call returns the original job (created: false)
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "report.generate", "idempotencyKey": "report-2026-01", "payload": {} }

### A job that can never succeed -> dead-letter after one attempt
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "email.send", "queue": "emails", "payload": { "subject": "no recipient" } }

### Workflow (DAG): a -> (b, c) -> d
POST {{host}}/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "nightly-2026-01-01",
  "steps": [
    { "key": "extract",   "type": "report.generate" },
    { "key": "transform", "type": "report.generate", "dependsOn": ["extract"] },
    { "key": "validate",  "type": "report.generate", "dependsOn": ["extract"] },
    { "key": "load",      "type": "report.generate", "dependsOn": ["transform", "validate"] }
  ]
}

### Transactional outbox: order row + confirmation e-mail job in ONE transaction
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "ana", "amount": 1499.50 }

### Inspect
GET {{host}}/stats

###
GET {{host}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Replay a dead-lettered job
POST {{host}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/requeue
